  "notes": "## 0.7.0 - 2026-05-10\n\n### Features\n\n- Add RPM packages and a Fedora COPR install channel so dnf-based Linux users can install and update UniClipboard through their package manager.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make LAN-only mode keep already-paired devices on local-network discovery and direct connections instead of still reaching them through public network services.\n- Make search match partial terms inside copied addresses and code-style text, such as localhost, IP addresses, and mixed-case identifiers.\n- Make Quick Panel paste on macOS more reliably return focus to the previous app before pasting the selected item.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.7.0 - 2026-05-10\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增 RPM 安装包和 Fedora COPR 安装渠道，使用 dnf 的 Linux 用户可以通过系统包管理器安装和更新 UniClipboard。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复仅局域网模式下已配对设备仍可能通过公网服务被触达的问题，现在会限制为局域网发现和直连。\n- 修复搜索无法按前缀命中复制内容中的地址和代码风格文本的问题，例如 localhost、IP 地址和混合大小写标识符。\n- 修复 macOS 上快捷面板粘贴时偶尔没有先回到原应用，导致所选内容未能可靠粘贴的问题。",
